#![Bandera ESP](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0E5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--c7812c9b5d2929fb4ed7644517bf4f9800a3d1e4/esp.png) **Español**
Si eres socio de la **Asociación Española de Speedcubing (AES)** a día 24 de octubre de 2026 y participas en la competición se te reembolsarán 2.4€ de la cuota de registro al finalizar ésta. Puedes hacerte socio de la AES pinchando [aquí](https://speedcubingspain.org/register/).

#![Bandera UK](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0U5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--2a28e3c285bf55a2606838971abb0514d0ef172c/UK.png) **English**
If you are **Spanish Speedcubing Association (AES)** member on October 24, 2026 and you participate in the competition, you will be reimbursed €2.4 of the registration fee at the end of the competition. You can join AES by clicking [here](https://speedcubingspain.org/register/).

#![Bandera ESP](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0E5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--c7812c9b5d2929fb4ed7644517bf4f9800a3d1e4/esp.png) **Español**
Si eres socio de la Asociación Española de Speedcubing (AES) se te reembolsará un 15% de la cuota de registro después de la competición.
Al registrarte en esta competición aceptas que **se te enviarán correos electrónicos informativos**. El equipo organizador no se hace responsable de los perjuicios ocasionados si se proporcionan direcciones de correo no funcionales.

#![Bandera UK](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBb0U5IiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--2a28e3c285bf55a2606838971abb0514d0ef172c/UK.png) **English**
For AES Members (Speedcubing Spanish Association), 15% of the registration fee will be reimbursed after the competition.
By registering to this competition you accept that **informative emails will be sent**. The organization team does not take responsibility for any damage caused if non-functional email adresses are provided.

![](https://www.worldcubeassociation.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/redirect/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6MjAwNjE4LCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--b43ed93d443e818ec3d1a884cc2d98984257c3d3/Your%20paragraph%20text%20(2)%20-%20Copia.png)

Dicas:
- Chegue ao local da competição pelo menos 30 minutos antes de modalidade que participará;
- O cubo que você irá competir deve estar em bom estado;
- Ao se inscrever você se compromete a ajudar como juiz, corredor ou qualquer função solicitada por um delegado da competição;
- Você é responsável pelo seu cubo e seus pertences, cuide deles. Não nos responsabilizamos por perda de cubos mágicos e outros pertences durante a competição;
- Se tiver alguma dúvida, não hesite em perguntar para a equipe de organização e delegados.
- Ao se inscrever você está autorizando o uso de imagem para divulgações sobre o campeonato.

Mesmo que a nossa competição seja formada por alguns competidores experientes, sempre teremos espaço para novos cubistas.
Procure se divertir bastante!


Tips:
- Arrive at the competition venue at least 30 minutes before the event you will be participating in;
- The cube you will be competing with must be in good condition;
- By registering, you agree to assist as a judge, runner, or in any other role requested by a delegate;
- You are responsible for your cube and your belongings, so take care of them. We are not responsible for the loss of magic cubes and other belongings during the competition;
- If you have any questions, don't hesitate to ask the organizing team and delegates.
- By registering, you are authorizing the use of your image for publicity about the competition.

Even though our competition is made up of some experienced competitors, we always have room for new cubers.
Have fun!

